  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Bugs found so far:\n1: Trigger is not analogue\n2: ActionMenu can't be operated without turning off vive advanced controlls, however if you do this you can't use the trigger anymore.\n3: the middle of the touch pad doesn't do anything, on live this was the second fist.\n4: all the gestures on the touchpad are rotated clockewise by one, so pointing is on victory.\n5: theres also a weird blue flash when loading into a world.\nThis is it so far.",
